{{define "content"}}
<h1>Stations / 站点配置</h1>

{{if .ShowOnboarding}}
<section class="card">
  <h2>Quick Setup / 快速配置</h2>
  <p>当前还没有任何站点，按下面步骤添加第一个上游中转站。</p>
  <p class="muted">Start the gateway locally, then add your first relay station.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>第一步 / Step 1</strong><br>
      网关默认地址 / Gateway default address: <code>http://{{.DefaultListenAddr}}</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>第二步 / Step 2</strong><br>
      为一个站点填写 OpenAI、Anthropic，或两者同时配置。每种协议的 Base URL 和 API Key 必须成对出现。<br>
      <span class="muted">Fill OpenAI, Anthropic, or both. Each protocol needs base URL + key together.</span><br>
      OpenAI base URL 示例: <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIBaseURL}}</code><br>
      Anthropic base URL 示例: <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicBaseURL}}</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>第三步 / Step 3</strong><br>
      保存站点后，到 <a href="/admin/mappings">Mappings</a> 页面建立模型别名映射。<br>
      OpenAI 别名示例: <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIAlias}}</code> → <code>{{.ExampleOpenAIModel}}</code><br>
      Anthropic 别名示例: <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicAlias}}</code> → <code>{{.ExampleAnthropicModel}}</code>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
{{end}}

{{if .EditStation}}
<p>当前正在编辑站点 / Editing station: <strong>{{.EditStation.Name}}</strong> · <a href="/admin/stations">取消编辑</a></p>
{{end}}

<form class="card" method="post" action="{{if .EditStation}}/admin/stations/update{{else}}/admin/stations{{end}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  {{if .EditStation}}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.EditStation.ID}}">{{end}}

  <fieldset>
    <legend>基础 / Basics</legend>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">站点名称 <span class="en">Station name</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">本地唯一标识，例如 <code>relay-a</code>，仅自己识别用。</span>
        <input name="name" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.Name}}{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <div class="field">
        <span class="field-label">启用状态 <span class="en">Enabled</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">禁用后该站点不会被路由选中，也不参与失败切换。</span>
        <label class="field-check">
          <input type="checkbox" name="enabled" {{if .EditStation}}{{if .EditStation.Enabled}}checked{{end}}{{else}}checked{{end}}>
          <span>启用此站点</span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>调度与冷却 / Scheduling</legend>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">优先级 <span class="en">Priority</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">数字越大越先尝试，主站点用较大值，备用站点用较小值。</span>
        <input name="priority" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.Priority}}{{else}}10{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">冷却时间（秒）<span class="en">Cooldown seconds</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">触发失败阈值后，该站点会被跳过这么多秒，建议 30~120。</span>
        <input name="cooldown_seconds" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.CooldownSeconds}}{{else}}30{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">失败阈值 <span class="en">Failure threshold</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">连续失败多少次后进入冷却。设为 1 表示一次失败就切换。</span>
        <input name="consecutive_failure_threshold" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.ConsecutiveFailureThreshold}}{{else}}1{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">恢复阈值 <span class="en">Recovery threshold</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">连续成功多少次后从冷却恢复为健康。</span>
        <input name="consecutive_recovery_threshold" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.ConsecutiveRecoveryThreshold}}{{else}}2{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">健康检查间隔（秒）<span class="en">Health interval</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">预留字段。当前后台健康检查固定为 15 秒，此处先随便填一个正整数。</span>
        <input name="health_check_interval_seconds" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.HealthCheckIntervalSeconds}}{{else}}15{{end}}" required>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">健康检查超时（秒）<span class="en">Health timeout</span></span>
        <span class="field-hint">预留字段。当前后台健康检查超时固定为 5 秒。</span>
        <input name="health_check_timeout_seconds" type="number" min="1" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.HealthCheckTimeoutSeconds}}{{else}}5{{end}}" required>
      </label>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>OpenAI 上游 / OpenAI Upstream</legend>
    <p class="field-hint" style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Base URL 和 API Key 必须成对填写；都留空表示此站点不承接 OpenAI 协议。</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">OpenAI Base URL</span>
        <span class="field-hint">填到 <code>/openai</code> 这一级，网关会自动拼接 <code>/v1/responses</code> 或 <code>/v1/chat/completions</code>。</span>
        <input name="openai_base_url" placeholder="https://relay-a.example.invalid/openai" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.OpenAIBaseURL}}{{end}}">
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">OpenAI API Key</span>
        <span class="field-hint">上游中转站发给你的真实密钥，会保存在本地 SQLite 里。</span>
        <input name="openai_api_key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.OpenAIAPIKey}}{{end}}">
      </label>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Anthropic 上游 / Anthropic Upstream</legend>
    <p class="field-hint" style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Base URL 和 API Key 必须成对填写；都留空表示此站点不承接 Anthropic 协议。</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">Anthropic Base URL</span>
        <span class="field-hint">填到 <code>/anthropic</code> 这一级，网关会自动拼接 <code>/v1/messages</code>。</span>
        <input name="anthropic_base_url" placeholder="https://relay-a.example.invalid/anthropic" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.AnthropicBaseURL}}{{end}}">
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">Anthropic API Key</span>
        <span class="field-hint">上游中转站给你的 Anthropic 密钥。</span>
        <input name="anthropic_api_key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" value="{{if .EditStation}}{{.EditStation.AnthropicAPIKey}}{{end}}">
      </label>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="actions">
    <button type="submit">{{if .EditStation}}Update Station{{else}}Save Station{{end}}</button>
    {{if .EditStation}}<a class="btn subtle" href="/admin/stations">取消</a>{{end}}
  </div>
</form>

<h2>Existing Stations / 已配置站点</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>名称 / Name</th>
      <th>启用</th>
      <th>优先级</th>
      <th>OpenAI Base URL</th>
      <th>Anthropic Base URL</th>
      <th>操作</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{range .Stations}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{.Name}}</td>
      <td>{{if .Enabled}}<span class="pill ok">on</span>{{else}}<span class="pill">off</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td>{{.Priority}}</td>
      <td class="muted">{{if .OpenAIBaseURL}}{{.OpenAIBaseURL}}{{else}}—{{end}}</td>
      <td class="muted">{{if .AnthropicBaseURL}}{{.AnthropicBaseURL}}{{else}}—{{end}}</td>
      <td>
        <a href="/admin/stations/edit?id={{.ID}}">编辑</a>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/stations/delete" style="display:inline;" data-confirm="Delete station {{.Name}}?">
          <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{$.WriteToken}}">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.ID}}">
          <button class="subtle" type="submit">Delete</button>
        </form>
      </td>
    </tr>
    {{else}}
    <tr>
      <td colspan="6" class="muted">No stations configured yet. / 还没有站点。</td>
    </tr>
    {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
{{end}}
